Breakdown:
  The first two log results are from the curl test. They are Suricata flagging the DNS query as suspicious.
  The rest of the log results are from the ping test. They are flagging the IMCP packets as suspicious because of the trailing :9. Normal echo packets end in :0. The packets
  having :9 is abnormal, so was flagged by the IDE.
Limitations:
  It is worth noting that the IDE didn't throw any errors for the nmap scans
